        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Greywind\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/greywind/48/2006_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Greywind:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Black Fist.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I really hope that’s a joke.</p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"jsz2\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n jsz2:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Mr. Fixer, before he became a mechanic.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Okay, I’ll bite, it sounds like there’s a story there.  How’d pre-Mr.-Fixer Mr. Fixer end up in Kirbyton?</p>",
